  "implementation": [
    "Optional Logic-only read-only CANN document mount; strict current-generation export keeps original content and permissions unchanged, without mounting private configuration or RAG indexes.",
    "CANN reuses the existing immutable room_agent_publication decision and v2 transport normalization. Current membership/task/developer authority applies before first publication; saved published replies keep their original content and receipt.",
    "Verifiable completed legacy replies adopt a publication record from original result and reservation/history. Incomplete, conflicting or ambiguous old evidence fails closed without model reexecution or history replacement.",
    "Trusted CANN allocation performs strict history recovery inside the existing session sequence transaction. Reservation GC before or after publication cannot cause a new message sequence. Ordinary Reserve and private/generic Agent paths are unchanged.",
    "Additive CANN publication migration and optional capability schema check; ACK, outbox, Kafka confirmation, Complete ordering and ephemeral delta contracts are unchanged."
  ],
